# U47 a: the Compare tab imports allflame_exp_048 on its first Draw (CompareEntry: LoadFromXML,
# the entry's tabs, SyncCalcsSkillSelection, BuildOutput; ImportBuild restores the title).
# Summary: the top-bar dividers, UpdateSetSelectors (the entry's spec/skill/item/config set
# lists, RefreshSkillSelectControls of the cmp* row), the shared view scroll bar (no content:
# hidden), wheel scrolling in the content area (HandleScrollInput, nothing to scroll).
#! u47-import allflame_exp_048.xml
#! u47-expect-text u47 SUMMARY allflame_exp_048
screen 1280 800 dpi 1
fixture userdir=../u46/user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 3
move 116 122
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 700 500
frames 2
wheel down 2
frames 2
wheel up 1
frames 2
